      "content": "I'll read the CUT and the original test file to understand what needs to be improved.Now I have a clear picture of the code. Let me write the improved test with these understandability improvements:\n\n1. Remove unnecessary `throws Exception` from `testGetJavaVersion`\n2. Add consistent, descriptive assertion messages to all `assertEquals` calls\n3. Replace vague comments (`// Failures`, `// LANG-1384`, `// 0.x`) with explanatory ones\n4. Remove the commented-out dead code (`assertNull` line)\n5. Improve `testAtLeast` messages to clearly state the expectation rather than \"passed\"/\"failed\" phrasing\n6. Group assertions with section comments for better navigationNow I'll run the compile check.The improved `JavaVersionTest.java` compiles successfully."
